@startuml
title Data-Flow Diagram — Level 0 (Context)

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangleBorderThickness 1

rectangle "Developer /\nCoding Agent" as User
circle "0\nOKS MCP\nServer" as System
rectangle "LLM API" as LLM
database "CERN TDAQ/OKS\nConfiguration" as Data

User --> System : natural-language question
System --> User : OksQuery + filtered results
System --> LLM : schema slice + question
LLM --> System : candidate OksQuery / repair
System --> Data : approved read-only query
Data --> System : matching objects + attributes

note bottom of System
  Context boundary: one stateless MCP capability
  translating and executing read-only OKS queries.
end note
@enduml
